# Tasks: Phase 1 Bug Fixes & Stability

**Input**: Design documents from `speckit.specify` and `speckit.plan`
**Target Branch**: `phase1-bug-fixes` (`/home/pplupo/repos/webui2`)

---

## Phase 1: #72 Fix URL Parsing Crash on Double Colons & Complex Titles

**Goal**: Prevent list view crashes caused by invalid URL parsing when task titles contain double colons (`::`) or malformed strings.

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T001 [P] Extract/refactor robust URL detection and sanitization helper in `frontend/utils/linkify.ts` (or local helper) requiring explicit schemes (`http://`, `https://`, `ftp://`) and `www.*` domains, ignoring pseudo-schemes like `Doug::`.
- [ ] T002 Update `frontend/components/TaskList.vue` to use the defensive linkification helper with URL constructor try/catch and fallback to plain text.
- [ ] T003 Update `frontend/components/KanbanCard.vue` to use the defensive linkification helper.
- [ ] T004 Verify rendering and pagination with tasks containing colons, double colons, and valid URLs.

---

## Phase 2: #89 100% Completed Projects Separation & Setting Toggle

**Goal**: Place 100% completed projects below a divider in the project selector and allow hiding them completely via a user setting (defaulting to hidden).

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T005 [P] Update Vuex store in `frontend/store/index.ts` to add computed getters for `activeProjects` (projects with at least one pending/waiting task) and `completedProjects` (projects where all tasks are completed/deleted).
- [ ] T006 Add `hideCompletedProjects: true` to settings state, mutations, and persistent storage in `frontend/store/index.ts`.
- [ ] T007 Add "Hide completed projects" checkbox in `frontend/components/SettingsDialog.vue`.
- [ ] T008 Update `projectOptions` in `frontend/pages/index.vue` to respect `hideCompletedProjects`: when false, append `{ divider: true }` and `completedProjects`; when true, only display active projects.
- [ ] T009 Verify project selector displays items as expected with settings toggled on and off.

---

## Phase 3: #59 Theme Include & CLI Data Fetching Robustness

**Goal**: Ensure Taskwarrior CLI output formatting and color themes never break backend JSON parsing.

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T010 [P] Update `backend/src/taskwarrior.ts` to enforce `rc._forcecolor=off` and `rc.defaultwidth=0` on Taskwarrior invocations.
- [ ] T011 Verify task loading and modification endpoints in `backend/src/tasks.ts` handle theme directives and CLI output reliably.

---

## Phase 4: #90 Prevent Input Field Offset on Mobile (iOS)

**Goal**: Eliminate input field coordinate and cursor offset desynchronization during validation errors on mobile devices.

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T012 Update `frontend/components/TaskDialog.vue` text fields with consistent layout containers or `hide-details="auto"` to prevent layout shifting on error messages.
- [ ] T013 Verify dialog input stability across validation error states on mobile viewports.
